# Machine-local compile-only inputs (never bundled into the release jar).
# libs/roadweaver-interop-compile-only.jar provides the RoadWeaver interop ABI
# for S2; regenerate it from the roadweaver checkout, see gradle/README-local-inputs.md.
libs/

# Test byproduct. GreatWallConfig.file() falls back to Path.of("config", ...) when
# FabricLoader.getConfigDir() throws, which is what happens in a bare JUnit JVM. Any
# test that reads or writes the config therefore creates this inside the project root,
# and it reappears on every test run - so it is ignored rather than committed.
config/

